{{!-- The fates a held arcanum's marked Consequence dictates, flagged in gold above the fate buttons of
      Death's Door's result step and of its fate step alike. Drawn in the calling step's own context, so
      `this.dictates` and `@root.dictatedOthers` read what they read there. --}}
{{#each this.dictates}}
<p class="deaths-door-dictated"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{this.text}}{{#if @last}} {{@root.dictatedOthers}}{{/if}}</p>
{{/each}}
